[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13320.07, "timestamp": "03:42:00", "text": "設定？わかった。えっと、押して、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13322.469, "timestamp": "03:42:02", "text": "それまでのことは知っておく。うん。それまで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13323.99, "timestamp": "03:42:03", "text": "ボタン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13326.99, "timestamp": "03:42:06", "text": "わかった。これは何ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13329.67, "timestamp": "03:42:09", "text": "わかった。ポップアップが表示されたら、設定が表示されます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13331.83, "timestamp": "03:42:11", "text": "まるでそれが表れるかのように上へ。選択できます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13333.15, "timestamp": "03:42:13", "text": "設定から"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13338.429, "timestamp": "03:42:18", "text": "うん。 G項目１。特別"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13341.91, "timestamp": "03:42:21", "text": "アイテムスピードタイマー。わかった。 FBカメラ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13344.55, "timestamp": "03:42:24", "text": "そこで揺すってください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13346.79, "timestamp": "03:42:26", "text": "うん。カメラの揺れはまだ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13349.83, "timestamp": "03:42:29", "text": "最低額は25%です。でも、設定して"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13351.88, "timestamp": "03:42:31", "text": "ゼロ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13353.15, "timestamp": "03:42:33", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13356.469, "timestamp": "03:42:36", "text": "ああ、もう少し配慮があればよかったのに。あなたはできる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13359.75, "timestamp": "03:42:39", "text": "ここで感度を変更してください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13363.11, "timestamp": "03:42:43", "text": "また、視野角（FOV）の加算値を増やすこともできます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13378.389, "timestamp": "03:42:58", "text": "わかった。"}]